## Interface: 16001
## Title: WowGPS
## Notes: Route planner for WoW Forever: pick a start and a destination, compare travel options (foot, mount, boat/zeppelin/tram, flight paths) and follow waypoints. Integrates with Routes and TomTom.
## Notes-itIT: Navigatore per WoW Forever: scegli partenza e destinazione, confronta le opzioni di viaggio (piedi, cavalcatura, navi/zeppelin/tram, voli) e segui i waypoint. Integrato con Routes e TomTom.
